[{"answer":"Excuse me, I was told to come here for advice about...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Management Diploma courses?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You've certainly come to the right place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, my name is Monica.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Nice to meet you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/5.mp3"},{"answer":"My name is Andrew, Andrew Harris.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So, Andrew, have you seen our diploma course prospectus yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've already looked at it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/8.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I thought the information on course content was really useful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/9.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm afraid I'm a bit confused by all the different ways you can do the course:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/10.mp3"},{"answer":"full-time intensive, part-time and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, let's see if I can help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I think each course type has its advantages and disadvantages, so it really depends on you -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/13.mp3"},{"answer":"your own study habits, and your financial circumstances, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you working at the moment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I've been working in the administration section of the local hospital for the last three years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And before that I worked in the office of a computer engineering company for two years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/17.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I've got about five years of relevant work experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And what I'm hoping to focus on is Personnel Management.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And are you planning to leave your current job to study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/21.mp3"},{"answer":"or are you thinking about just taking a year off?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I want to know what my options are, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't want to quit my job or anything","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and my employers are keen for me to get some more qualifications","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but obviously, it would be better if I could do a course without taking too much time away from work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so you don't really want to do the full-time course, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/27.mp3"},{"answer":"No, not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/28.mp3"},{"answer":"It's also a question of finances.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/29.mp3"},{"answer":"You see, my office have agreed to pay the cost of the course itself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/30.mp3"},{"answer":"but I would have to take unpaid leave if I want to study full-time and, well...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I could afford to support myself with no salary for a whole year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you have two other possibilities:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/34.mp3"},{"answer":"you could either do the part-time course -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/35.mp3"},{"answer":"that would be over two years and you wouldn't have to take any time off work -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/36.mp3"},{"answer":"or you could do what we call a 'modular' course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You could do that in eighteen months if you wanted or longer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/38.mp3"},{"answer":"it's quite flexible and it would be up to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So what does the part-time course involve?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/40.mp3"},{"answer":"For that you would join an evening class and have a lecture twice a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, you'd have to attend a seminar or discussion workshop one weekend a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/42.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of coursework would I have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's a mixture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/44.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd be expected to write an essay each month, which counts towards your final assessment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You have a case study to do by the end of the course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/46.mp3"},{"answer":"which might involve doing a survey or something like that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and also you need to hand in a short report every four weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So, that's quite a lot of work, then, on top of working every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds like a lot of studying and really tiring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you certainly wouldn't have much free time!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/51.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the 'modular' course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/52.mp3"},{"answer":"What would I have to do for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/53.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where you get the opportunity to study full-time for short periods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That way you can cover a lot of coursework","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and attend lectures and seminars during the day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And each module lasts for one term, say, about twelve weeks at a time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/57.mp3"},{"answer":"There are obvious advantages in this -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/58.mp3"},{"answer":"the main one being that you can study in a much more intensive way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/59.mp3"},{"answer":"which suits some people much better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And how many of these 'modules' would I have to do to get the diploma?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/61.mp3"},{"answer":"The current programme is two modules -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and then you have to choose a topic to work in more depth -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/63.mp3"},{"answer":"but you can base that on your job,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and so you don't need to be away from the office,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and how long it takes is up to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The important thing is that you don't have to study and work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/67.mp3"},{"answer":"You can focus on one thing at a time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can see that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/69.mp3"},{"answer":"It certainly sounds attractive!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be more expensive, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, I'd have to support myself without pay for each module.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/72.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true, so that might be a problem for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, why don't you talk this over with your employers...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-3-2023-08-04-13-17-31/74.mp3"}]
